## Technical requirements

The [[product data specification](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/188494)](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/188494) defines the structure and format for providing data about your products so that attractive and professional ads can be created. Your promotions will need to comply with the product data specification to appear in Shopping ads, so make sure that you review the attributes and their requirements carefully.

## Examples of what's not allowed

- Examples: Website has broken links, templated content, placeholders of text or placeholders for images.
Learn [how to fix this issue](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/12056511).
- Examples: Website is missing contact information (e.g. no social media link, contact email address or phone number); Merchant Centre account has missing contact information, such as a physical business address or a verified phone number; contact information is missing from both the shop website and Merchant Centre account.
- Examples: Shop return or cancellation policy pages that are empty or don't state all the requirements for return or cancellation; refund or cancellation policies that aren't clear or easy to find; no return, refund or cancellation policy is clearly stated; auto-renewal practices or notification methods for billing changes aren't clear or easy to find.
- Examples: Websites with pop-ups or interstitial ads that interfere with the customer's ability to see the requested content; sites that require a visitor to enter a username or password to see the requested content; sites that disable or interfere with the browser's back button; websites that don't load quickly on most popular browsers and devices, are under construction, not functioning, require download of an additional application to view the landing page (aside from common browser plug-ins) or that lead to a file, email address or error messages. For specific guidelines on how to comply with this policy, refer to the 'link' attributes in the [product data specification](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/188494)
